{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa in San Francisco", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "This Line of Work", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs in common social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "PlaceholderUnderstands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Asking and Giving Permission", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you ask for permission, it is important to be polite.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You often use a modal like <span class=\"italic\">can, may, could</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would</span> to ask for permission.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also ask a Yes or No question like <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIs it OK if ... \u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cDo you mind ... \u201d</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are some ways to ask for and give permission.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Permission </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Giving Permission </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I take a few days off next week?<br /> Can I ask you something?<br /> Would it be all right if I change projects?<br /> Do you mind if someone takes my shifts next week?<br /> Is it OK if I leave early today?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure.<br />  Perhaps.<br />  Of course.<br />  No problem.<br />  I don't mind.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "&nbsp;", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Showing Flexibility (Possibility)", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can express possibility using a modal like <span class=\"italic\">might</span> or <span class=\"italic\">may</span>.  You can also use some words and expressions like  <span class=\"italic\">it's a possibility</span> or <span class=\"italic\">there's a chance</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Nancy might agree.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Frank may want to work on that project. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Perhaps John will work with us. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Maybe Heather is interested in changing shifts.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "workload", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the amount of work a person or group of people must complete", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  The workload is pretty heavy during the Christmas season.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "line of work", "type": "name"}, {"content": "industry; field; area of business", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a reality in our line of work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shift ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the time a person is scheduled to work in one day", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could somebody take some of my shifts next week? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "extended hours", "type": "name"}, {"content": " longer periods of work than what is normally the case", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I could do extended hours when I get back.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "possibility", "type": "name"}, {"content": "chance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What you are suggesting is a possibility.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "short of staff", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not having enough employees to do the work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't want to be short of staff. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, choose 3 different lines of work to discuss. Choose general areas of work, like healthcare or travel, not specific jobs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the table.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss those lines of work. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Which line of work do you find interesting? Explain why.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Line of work: \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When it is very busy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When it is not busy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Good things\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Bad things \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I choose 3 lines of work to discuss.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I complete the table about work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss different lines of work with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome"}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le04ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le04ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"id": 0, "text": "", "image": "engenn5le04ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "0"}, {"id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hi Daniel!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Daniel</span>:  Hi, Vanessa.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I have a friend from Cambridge staying with me right now. Could I take a few days off next week?", "image": "engenn5le04ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "100"}, {"id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Daniel</span>: Perhaps, but the workload is pretty heavy during the Christmas season, you know. It's a reality in our line of work.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Yes, I know that. Do you mind if someone takes my shifts next week? I could do extended hours when I get back.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Daniel</span>: It's a possibility, but I don't want to be short of staff. We have to maintain quality service at this time of year.", "image": "engenn5le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "8000"}, {"id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I understand.  Do you mind if I ask Nancy?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Daniel</span>: I don't mind. Nancy might agree. I know she wants to have time off after New Years. You could ask her to trade shifts.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ok, thank you, Daniel.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Daniel</span>:  Good luck!", "image": "engenn5le04ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "29000"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio"}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask and give permission.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can show flexibility.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What is your line (area) of work?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What is the busiest time of year? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Is there a slow time of the year? When?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_atte